exports[`templates — snapshots > account_exists subject/text/html is unchanged > account_exists.text 1`] = `
"oh. — ohmail

You already have an ohmail account

Someone just tried to create an ohmail account with this address. There is already one, so nothing was created and nothing changed.
If that was you: sign in instead — your existing account is untouched.
If it was not you: you can ignore this. Whoever tried was not told whether this address has an account, and they have no way in without your password or your passkey.
Sign in: https://ohmail.app/login

—
Reach a human: support@ohmail.app
TrafficFlow GmbH, Zürich, Switzerland
"
`;

