"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>[production] ohmail: daily alert summary — 4 incidents</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px 16px;background:#ffffff;color:#1e1a16;font:15px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:18px;">[production] ohmail: daily alert summary — 4 incidents</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Incidents since 2026-08-20T09:05:00.000Z.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">[critical] 1 send stuck — sends_stuck — opened 2026-08-21T07:40:00.000Z</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">[warning] imap_admission_refused — imap_admission_refused — opened 2026-08-20T22:10:00.000Z — resolved 2026-08-20T23:30:00.000Z</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">2 more — open the console.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;"><a href="https://admin.ohmail.app/">Open the admin console</a></p>
<p style="margin:24px 0 0;color:#5c534b;font-size:13px;">Sent at most once every 24 h, listing every incident that opened, stood or cleared since the last summary. Nothing is sent when there is nothing to list.</p>
